  "citation": "Farley M; Lathrop E; Dillard S; Crumley R; Trotter C; Gasarch E; Yang D; Bolton B; Abolt C J; Huang X; Bennett K E (2025): Soil Texture and Organic Matter from Teller Field Site and Barrow Environmental Observatory, Alaska, 2024. Next-Generation Ecosystem Experiments (NGEE) Arctic. Dataset. doi:10.15485/2587411",
  "dataset": {
